# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Knowledge-base files produced at runtime.
# `rag.add_resolution` writes resolved-ticket-YYYYMMDD-HHMMSS.md into
# backend/data/kb/ (the two resolved-ticket-10xx files there are seed docs and
# stay tracked), and uploads have no separate storage directory.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
backend/data/kb/resolved-ticket-????????-??????.md
backend/data/uploads/

